WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.808 --> 00:00:14.877
"That blob your bubble gum?"

2
00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:16.038
asked Roxy.

3
00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:18.700
"Yes!" cried Mara.

4
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.863
"I blew a bubble, and it just grew and grew!"

5
00:00:23.863 --> 00:00:25.084
The blob rumbled again.

6
00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:30.168
Grarg! Roxy grabbed Mara and flew her to a safe spot.

7
00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:32.889
They landed on top of a tall building.

8
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.511
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:36.311
said Mara.

10
00:00:36.331 --> 00:00:38.912
"No problem," said Roxy.

11
00:00:39.953 --> 00:00:42.194
Roxy and Mara watched the blob grow some more.

12
00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:46.417
Grarg! It soon covered a whole city block!

13
00:00:46.437 --> 00:00:50.339
"What kind of bubble gum were you chewing?"

14
00:00:50.659 --> 00:00:51.319
asked Roxy.

15
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.941
Mara pulled the pack out of her pocket.

16
00:00:53.961 --> 00:00:56.362
"It's a new kind," she said.

17
00:00:56.382 --> 00:00:58.723
"It's called 'Mrs.

18
00:00:58.803 --> 00:00:59.664
Wiggles Gum.'"

19
00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:01.508
"Mrs. Wiggles?"

20
00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:02.509
said Roxy.

21
00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:06.350
"She owns the new candy factory just outside Metro City.

22
00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:10.132
Maybe I should go talk to—" "Talk to whom?"

23
00:01:10.552 --> 00:01:11.753
said a voice from behind them.

24
00:01:12.913 --> 00:01:13.933
Roxy spun around.

25
00:01:14.914 --> 00:01:16.955
A tall woman with a tall hat stood there.

26
00:01:16.975 --> 00:01:19.516
"Who are you?"

27
00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:20.536
asked Roxy.

28
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:22.717
"I am Mrs.

29
00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:24.298
Wiggles," said the woman.

30
00:01:24.318 --> 00:01:29.560
"Soon my bubble gum blob will cover the entire city!

31
00:01:30.988 --> 00:01:36.793
The blob will stay unless Mayor Bloom pays me one million dollars!"

32
00:01:38.674 --> 00:01:39.555
Roxy scowled.

33
00:01:39.575 --> 00:01:41.797
"That's what you think, Mrs.

34
00:01:41.937 --> 00:01:45.020
Wiggles!" Roxy took a step toward the villain.

35
00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.382
Just then Roxy heard a shout.

36
00:01:47.402 --> 00:01:49.723
"Help us, Rocket Girl!"

37
00:01:50.924 --> 00:01:51.785
Roxy looked down.

38
00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:54.567
Several people were stuck in the blob!

39
00:01:55.468 --> 00:01:57.109
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

40
00:01:57.129 --> 00:01:59.551
"See you later, Rocket Girl!"

41
00:02:01.504 --> 00:02:03.426
The villain pulled a long rope from her coat.

42
00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:06.889
She threw it over the side of the building and zipped down.

43
00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.592
A truck shaped like a jelly bean was waiting for her.

44
00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:13.234
Mrs. Wiggles hopped in and sped off.

45
00:02:15.957 --> 00:02:16.978
Roxy looked at Mara.

46
00:02:16.998 --> 00:02:18.479
"You wait here!"

47
00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.562
Roxy shot down to the blob.

48
00:02:23.984 --> 00:02:25.105
She grabbed a man's arm.

49
00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.707
"Please help me, Rocket Girl!"

50
00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:28.508
said the man.

51
00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:31.413
"I don't want to be eaten by bubble gum!"

52
00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:34.295
"Just relax," said Roxy.

53
00:02:35.235 --> 00:02:36.316
"I'll get you out of here."

54
00:02:39.197 --> 00:02:40.958
Roxy pulled each person out of the blob.

55
00:02:42.339 --> 00:02:44.140
She flew each one to a safe spot.

56
00:02:46.561 --> 00:02:48.683
The blob stretched and grabbed more buildings.

57
00:02:49.823 --> 00:02:52.104
Soon all of downtown Metro City was covered.

58
00:02:52.124 --> 00:02:55.526
"I'm getting really tired of this dumb blob!"

59
00:02:55.766 --> 00:02:56.367
said Roxy.

60
00:02:58.764 --> 00:03:00.465
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams.

61
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:06.229
Ka-boom! The bubble gum blob exploded into hundreds of little pieces!

62
00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.111
Roxy smiled.

63
00:03:08.131 --> 00:03:11.753
"Good. No more—" Rumble!

64
00:03:12.054 --> 00:03:16.437
Rumble! Suddenly the earth shook, and loud rumbles filled the air.

65
00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.219
All of the tiny blobs were now moving.

66
00:03:20.119 --> 00:03:21.180
And they were all growing!

67
00:03:25.603 --> 00:03:26.364
Roxy gulped.

68
00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:29.996
"I think I just made things a whole lot worse!"
